      "content": "<p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001012001\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Marathahalli, in East Bangalore, has become one of the most popular residential and commercial destinations in the city. Famous for its great connectivity, lively lifestyle, and close proximity to major IT parks, Marathahalli attracts professionals, families, and investors. In this blog, we discuss the major reasons why Marathahalli is a wonderful place to live - from location and infrastructure to lifestyle amenities and future growth opportunities.<br></span></p><h2><b><br>Table of Contents</b></h2><ul><li>Where is Marathahalli Located?</li><li>Connectivity and Transportation</li><li>Housing Options in Marathahalli</li><li>Educational Institutions Nearby</li><li>Healthcare Facilities in Marathahalli</li><li>Shopping, Dining &amp; Entertainment</li><li>Suitability for Working Professionals</li><li>Lifestyle and Community Living</li><li>Cost of Living in Marathahalli</li><li>Real Estate Investment Potential</li><li>Challenges of Living in Marathahalli</li><li>Final Verdict: Should You Live in Marathahalli?</li><li>FAQs<span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001012001\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></span></li></ul><div><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Where is Marathahalli Located?</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocwr27i84moela\",\"id\":\"toc_8ovyausn4a45\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8ovyausn4a45\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocwr27i84moela\",\"id\":\"toc_8ovyausn4a45\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8ovyausn4a45\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Marathahalli is situated in the eastern part of Bangalore, strategically positioned near the Outer Ring Road (ORR). It serves as a gateway to the IT hubs of Whitefield, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/pros-and-cons-of-living-in-bellandur-bangalore#:~:text=From%20hip%20cafes%20and%20coworking,connectivity%20are%20issues%20of%20reality.\" target=\"_blank\">Bellandur</a>,</span> and Electronic City, making it a preferred residential choice for IT professionals. The locality is bordered by areas such as Kundalahalli, HSR Layout, and Banaswadi, offering a blend of urban convenience and suburban calm.</span></p><p></p></div>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p><b>Note:</b>&nbsp;Thinking of moving to Marathahalli with your family and exploring top-rated apartments? <a href=\"https://www.storeboard.com/blogs/real-estate/living-in-marathahalli--best-apartment-communities-for-families-and-singles/6273682\" target=\"_blank\">Discover the best apartment communities</a> in Marathahalli designed for family living.</p><p><br></p><h2><b>Connectivity and Transportation</b></h2><p>Marathahalli has superb connectivity to important areas of Bangalore and is hence a desirable destination for residents as well as professionals. Located on the Outer Ring Road, it provides smooth connectivity to Whitefield, Silk Board, Koramangala, and the airport. The Marathahalli Bridge is a vital junction connecting the eastern suburbs. Public transport is well-developed with frequent BMTC buses connecting it to important parts of the city. The future extension of the Namma Metro Purple Line will add to connectivity further by connecting Marathahalli to business centers. Its vicinity to IT parks such as ITPL and Manyata Tech Park shortens traveling time for information technology professionals.<br></p><h2><b><br>Housing Options in Marathahalli</b></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/advantages-and-disadvantages-of-living-in-marathahalli\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">Marathahalli</a> </span>offers a wide range of residential options catering to diverse preferences and budgets:<br></p><p><b>Apartments:</b> From affordable 1 and 2 BHK <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-marathahalli\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Apartments in Marathahalli</a> to luxury 3 and 4 BHK apartments in gated communities with modern amenities.<br><b>Independent Houses and Villas:</b> Spacious homes for those seeking privacy and exclusivity.<br><b>Gated Communities:</b> Secure complexes with facilities like clubhouses, swimming pools, gyms, landscaped gardens, and children’s play areas.<br><b>Row Houses and Duplexes:</b> Popular among families looking for a balance between apartment living and independent homes.<br></p><h2><b><br>Educational Institutions Nearby</b></h2><p>Marathahalli is an excellent option for families due to its&nbsp; close proximity to Excellent schools and colleges. Within a few kilometers, you'll find prestigious institutions like Delhi Public School East, Oakridge International School, and National Public School. These establishments offer various educational formats, including CBSE, ICSE, and international programs.</p><p>Furthermore, Marathahalli features respected academies such as New Horizon Gurukul, Narayana E-Techno School, and Insight Academy that serve students from nursery up through higher secondary levels. For those interested in pursuing higher education, Christ University is roughly 18 kilometers away, along with other nearby colleges like New Horizon College of Engineering and CMR Institute of Technology. This prime location ensures that residents have access to a diverse range of high-quality educational options.</p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Healthcare Facilities in Marathahalli</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc0de9le19m99n\",\"id\":\"toc_sekpbvh8gsoz\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_sekpbvh8gsoz\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc0de9le19m99n\",\"id\":\"toc_sekpbvh8gsoz\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_sekpbvh8gsoz\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Marathahalli residents enjoy quality healthcare, as multiple leading multispeciality hospitals are in close proximity - Narayana Multispecialty Hospital, Columbia Asia and Manipal Hospital. In addition, there is also the option of advanced treatment and emergency services 24/7 locally in Marathahalli with well-known hospitals such as Jeevika Hospital and Kauvery Hospital. Marathahalli not only educationally offers these general hospitals, it also has many specialty clinics and diagnostic companies, including ARK Healthcare, a large facility that provides all aspects of healthcare services, Pathology, Imaging and Health checks, in one location. Cloudnine Hospital provides maternity and child care. In addition, Cloudnine provides specialist neonatal and paediatric intensive care and has specially trained doctors and paediatric quality care for children. Therefore, in Marathahalli there is a well integrated and structured healthcare system that provides quality health care for the intricacies of their residential health needs..<br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Shopping, Dining &amp; Entertainment</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toca8k6v9i0mpj2\",\"id\":\"toc_fdli0mb3qfpy\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_fdli0mb3qfpy\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toca8k6v9i0mpj2\",\"id\":\"toc_fdli0mb3qfpy\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_fdli0mb3qfpy\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Marathahalli is a bustling destination for shopping, dining, and entertainment. Marathahalli boasts trendy malls such as KLM Mall and Brookefield Mall, not to mention popular nearby destinations like VR Bengaluru and Phoenix Marketcity. Malls contain a mix of branded retail stores, multiplex cinemas, and a varied collection of food options from Indian to International. Local markets provide convenience by offering fresh produce and everyday consumables with a local twist. The food scene is just as active with chic cafes and restaurants for every palate. Residents can enjoy movie theatres, gaming zones, and vibrant bars all located in the malls. This combination of modern retail, traditional shopping, and wonderfully rich food and leisure options have contributed to Marathahalli being an active, convenient place to live.<br><br></span></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Suitability for Working Professionals</b></span></span></h2><p></p><p>Marathahalli is particularly favored by IT professionals because of its strategic location near large IT parks such as ITPL, Bagmane Tech Park, and Embassy Tech Village, which facilitate shorter travel times. The locality enjoys well-developed road connectivity, such as the Outer Ring Road, which facilitate daily commutes. Marathahalli also has many coworking spaces and business centers like iKeva and Novel Business Park, which serve startups and freelancers with flexible office space. Increased business outlets and a thriving business culture offer sufficient employment opportunities, which have made Marathahalli a choice residential and professional destination for the IT sector in Bangalore</p><h2><b><br>Lifestyle and Community Living</b></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></p><p>Marathahalli provides a well-balanced lifestyle with plenty of gated communities that provide security and community living. These complexes offer facilities such as gyms, swimming pools, clubhouses, and neatly maintained parks. The residents get to enjoy the green spaces such as Munekollal Lake Park, which has jogging tracks and open spaces for outdoor recreation. Fitness seekers are benefited by multiple gyms, yoga centers, and sports facilities such as Yesh Turf Park with cricket and football courts. Also, social infrastructure such as community halls, clubs, and cultural centers encourages active social life and a lively neighborhood environment, making Marathahalli suitable for professionals and families alike.<br><br></p><h2><b>Cost of Living in Marathahalli</b></h2><p>The cost of living in Marathahalli is moderate compared to other prime localities in Bangalore:<br><br></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001012001\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\"><b>Category</b></span></p></td><td><p><span style=\"\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";\"=\"\"><b>Families</b></span></p></td><td><p><span style=\"\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";\"=\"\"><b>Couples&nbsp;</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Bachelors&nbsp;<span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001012001\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">&nbsp;</span></b></p></td><td><p><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001012001\" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"